'Execute all the period concepts before Role and not depending on currency

'In this group we execute the theoretical time and we assign the correct dates for prorates
SCO_HRPERIOD_CALC.ExecuteGroup("1")

'Now we execute all the items that needs the theoretical time but without slices
SCO_HRPERIOD_CALC.ExecuteGroup("11")

'In this group we produces the slices in the units with the dependences
SCO_HRPERIOD_CALC.ExecuteGroup("12")

Return(0)
